[{"id": 0, "chunk": ["Dogs (*Canis lupus familiaris*) are domesticated carnivores known for their loyalty, companionship, and intelligence. Often referred to as \"man's best friend,\" dogs have lived alongside humans for tens of thousands of years.", "### Key Characteristics\n- **Social Nature:** Highly pack-oriented, forming strong emotional bonds with human families.\n- **Senses:** Exceptional sense of smell and acute hearing, making them great working animals (search and rescue, service dogs, hunting).\n- **Varied Breeds:** Over 300 distinct breeds ranging in size from tiny Chihuahuas to giant Mastiffs.\n- **Lifespan:** Typically 10 to 14 years depending on size, health, and breed."], "embedding": [-0.025294777005910873, -0.028854388743638992, 0.07070192694664001, 0.09163499623537064, -0.07134613394737244, 0.02706918492913246, -0.08700776100158691, -0.007611275650560856, -0.06112825870513916, 0.02405107580125332, 0.06556014716625214, -0.05409136414527893, 0.04835346341133118, 0.05382959172129631, -0.03307552635669708, -0.0027218626346439123, -0.02504655346274376, -0.12110649049282074, 0.018467670306563377, 0.010364677757024765, -0.013229179196059704, -0.052779875695705414, 0.001884333323687315, -0.05708569660782814, -0.036016594618558884, -0.03140231966972351, -0.04173612967133522, -0.04863888770341873, -0.010042818263173103, 0.030812149867415428, -0.00886770710349083, 0.03231799229979515, 0.0483534038066864, 0.04772169515490532, -0.031079836189746857, 0.010619889944791794, 0.036927055567502975, 0.029043208807706833, 0.019021818414330482, 0.0029086852446198463, -0.03071722947061062, 0.005892893765121698, 0.03705938905477524, -0.10747358947992325, -0.07788560539484024, -0.028383614495396614, -0.112884022295475, -0.10485035926103592, -0.047292452305555344, 0.01472450140863657, -0.06310808658599854, 0.02455521561205387, 0.07629220187664032, 0.04190245270729065, 0.05749917030334473, -0.07195404171943665, -0.10054688900709152, -0.03415197506546974, -0.0352554842829704